<article class="env-lemma" id="0CQV">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0CQV">Lemma <span data-tag="0CQV">15.37.4</span>.</a> With same assumptions as Lemma <a href="/tag/0CQU" data-tag="0CQU">15.37.3</a> if $M = \bigcup _{n \geq 1} N_ n$ for some closed subgroups $N_ n$, then $N_ n$ is open for some $n$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      If not, then $U_ n = M \setminus N_ n$ is dense for all $n$ and we get a contradiction with Lemma <a href="/tag/0CQU" data-tag="0CQU">15.37.3</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>